                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for sarah_lw &amp;lt;wei3.liu@intel.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/13044cca-a7c8-11e7-b786-5254006e85c2" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/13044cca-a7c8-11e7-b786-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_154d failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
